    {
      "title": "Webhooks",
      "description": "Outbound event delivery, plus the event stream that backs it.\n\n**Verify every payload.** If the webhook has a secret, each request carries\n`X-Evora-Timestamp` and `X-Evora-Signature`, where the signature is\n`HMAC_SHA256(secret, timestamp + \".\" + rawBody)` as lowercase hex. Compute\nit over the RAW body before JSON parsing, compare with a constant-time\nfunction, and reject anything whose timestamp is far from now. An endpoint\nthat skips this can be driven by anyone who learns its URL.\n\n**Deduplicate on `X-Evora-Event-Id`.** Retries reuse the same id, so\nrecording processed ids is what keeps a redelivery from granting twice.\n`X-Evora-Delivery-Attempt` tells you which try you are receiving.\n\n**Delivery is at-least-once, not guaranteed.** A non-2xx response is\nretried with exponential backoff — 6 attempts across roughly two hours —\nafter which the event is left in the stream and not retried again. An\nendpoint that keeps failing is auto-disabled and the developer notified.\n\nThe retry window is deliberately short: enforcement is pull-based, so a\nmissed webhook can never grant or extend access. For anything longer than\na brief outage, read `GET /apps/{appId}/events?since=` — that is the\ndurable path, and it works even with no webhook configured.\n",
      "links": [
        {
          "id": "api-get-apps-appid-webhooks",
          "label": "List webhooks",
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/apps/{appId}/webhooks"
        },
        {
          "id": "api-post-apps-appid-webhooks",
          "label": "Create a webhook",
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/apps/{appId}/webhooks"
        },
        {
          "id": "api-get-apps-appid-webhooks-webhookid",
          "label": "Get a webhook",
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/apps/{appId}/webhooks/{webhookId}"
        },
        {
          "id": "api-put-apps-appid-webhooks-webhookid",
          "label": "Update a webhook",
          "method": "PUT",
          "path": "/apps/{appId}/webhooks/{webhookId}"
        },
        {
          "id": "api-delete-apps-appid-webhooks-webhookid",
          "label": "Delete a webhook",
          "method": "DELETE",
          "path": "/apps/{appId}/webhooks/{webhookId}"
        },
        {
          "id": "api-post-apps-appid-webhooks-webhookid-test",
          "label": "Fire a test delivery",
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/apps/{appId}/webhooks/{webhookId}/test"
        },
        {
          "id": "api-get-apps-appid-events",
          "label": "Read the event stream (catch-up)",
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/apps/{appId}/events"
        }
      ]
    },
